<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Highest/Lowest Australian P-E Ratios - Nov 14.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Highest/Lowest Australian P-E Ratios - Nov 14.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
